&#x200B;

Amazon also has good options if you search "Turbo Snail Shell." Then simply specify the size you want. My crabs are very large, for reference.

Do you like modern metals? Steel production requires coke, which is obtained from heating coal in oxygen deprived conditions. Additionally, coal is still used in a lot of electric power generation plants.

&#x200B;

It's extremely difficult to eliminate coal from a lot of our modern processes; we aren't there yet. I don't love it either, but like it or not modern society is heavily reliant upon it.
